 \ReviewerComment{a. The period chosen (2004-2021) is not even representative of a climatological period which is usually between 20-30 years. Since you are using only 70\% of the data for training, the model has not even seen 12 years of climate variability. I recommend using at least 20 years of data for building the model, perhaps more, 30 is better. Additionally, predicting for a period of <3 years is not ideal as you have not even tested the extratropical influence of at least a full cycle of El-Niño Southern Oscillation.}
 
